    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 7 Abbeyfields is a most impressive four bedroom semi-detached home, located in a small, quiet, well established residential development, situated within walking distance of Loughrea town centre and all it's social and recreational amenities and is also located approximately a 5 minute drive from M6 motorway. \n\nThis property is presented for sale in excellent condition, boasting bright and spacious accommodation, affording one the opportunity here to acquire a quality home in a most convenient location.\n\nFurther particulars available from sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 4.14m x 1.91m\nFront aspect window and door, wooden flooring\n\nSitting Room - 4.60m x 4.20m\nFront aspect window, solid fuel fireplace with surround, carpet flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.09m x 6.22m\nRear aspect window and sliding door, fitted wall and base units, wooden flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.95m x 2.00m\nRear aspect door, wooden flooring\n\nGround Floor wc - 0.91m x 2.05m\nRear aspect window, whb/wc, wooden flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.17m x 4.10m\nHotpress/airing cupboard off, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.93m x 1.39m\nFront aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.13m x 3.75m\nFront aspect window, carpet flooring - Ensuite: 0.93m x 2.51m - Side aspect window, whb/wc/shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.03m x 2.99m\nRear aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.61m x 3.15m\nRear aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nGarden - \nDriveway, front garden laid to lawn with mature trees and shrubbery, side access to rear garden - Rear garden, laid to lawn, brick boundary\n\n"
      },
